This enhances the fix of https://github.com/eclipse-equinox/p2/issues/17.
@laeubi is there a certain reason you skipped these poms?

Like https://github.com/eclipse-equinox/p2/pull/18 it changes the `groupId` of multiple plug-ins from `org.eclipse.equinox` to `org.eclipse.equinox.p2`. But when looking at Maven-Central (e.g. [o.e.equinox.p2.director.app](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.eclipse.platform/org.eclipse.equinox.p2.director.app/1.2.100
)) it seems that those plug-ins are published as part of `groupId` `org.eclipse.platform` that is completely unrelated to the groupIds used directly in the poms. And IIRC the publication process of those Eclipse-Platform Plug-in to Maven-Central changes the so groupdId so the change here should not be a problem.
@mickaelistria @akurtakov is that correct?


Furthermore this removes the unused org.eclipse.equinox.p2.tests-parent (at least it looks like that).

