Modified aspects of simplicity to include a beta repeat action that allows adding beta and other jvm options to servers and clients in FAT buckets

fixes #20876 

With these changes, beta options can be easily added to FAT buckets like so
```
@RunWith(Suite.class)
@SuiteClasses({
                SimpleTest.class,
})
public class FATSuite {
    // Using the RepeatTests @ClassRule will cause all tests to be run once per action. In this case it will run six times
    @ClassRule
    public static RepeatTests r = RepeatTests.withoutModification()
                    .andWith(FeatureReplacementAction.BETA_OPTION()) // Run with no modifications to the server besides enabling Beta
                    .andWith(FeatureReplacementAction.EE8_FEATURES())
                    .andWith(FeatureReplacementAction.EE8_FEATURES().withBeta()) // Run with EE8 Features and beta mode enabled
                    .andWith(new JakartaEE9Action())
                    .andWith(new JakartaEE9Action().withBeta()); // Run with EE9 Features, transforming apps, and beta mode enabled
}
```
